#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Nílò Ìdánimọ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Fi àmì sí àpótí yìí tí Ibùdó náà bá sábà máa ń dá Àṣìṣe 401 padà nítorí pé ó nílò Orúkọ Olùlò àti Ọ̀rọ̀ Aṣínà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Olùpèsè Aṣojú"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Tí ọ̀rọ̀ ìsopọ̀ yìí bá nílò aṣojú (proxy), yàn án níbí. Bíbẹ́ẹ̀kọ́ yan 'Kò sí'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò Ìwé-ẹ̀rí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Tí o bá ń lo SSL, ṣàmì sí àpótí yìí tí o bá fẹ́ fọwọ́sí ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà. Ó wà ní ṣíṣí ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀, pa á tí Ibùdó náà bá ń lo ìwé-ẹ̀rí tí a fọwọ́sí fúnra rẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò kí o sì fi tó ni létí nípa ìparí ìwé-ẹ̀rí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Tí o bá ń lo SSL, ṣàmì sí àpótí yìí tí o bá fẹ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò ìparí ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà. O lè ṣètò nínú Àwọn Ètò iye ọjọ́ ṣáájú ìparí tí a óò fi ìfitónilétí ránṣẹ́.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Àwọn Pàrámítà"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Ìgbàgbà Láti Dánwò"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Ṣe àyẹ̀wò ní gbogbo ìṣiṣẹ́ olùṣàyẹ̀wò ìgbà xth"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Okùnfà"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Ìgbà mélòó ni iṣẹ́ náà gbọ́dọ̀ wà ní ÌSÀLẸ̀ kí ímeèlì ìkìlọ̀ tó bẹ̀rẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Ìfitọ́nilétí àkókò gígùn"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Tí àkókò ìdánwò bá ju iye yìí lọ ní ọ̀pọ̀ ìgbà tẹ̀léra, fi ìfitónilétí ránṣẹ́. Ó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú iye Àkókò ìdúró onírúurú. Ìdánwò náà ń jogún àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́ tí ó pọ̀ jùlọ láti inú Àwọn Ètò. Tí a bá ṣètò iye tí ó ga jù níbí, àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́ tí ó pọ̀ jùlọ jẹ́ iye yìí + ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìrúfin àkókò tẹ̀léra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Ìgbà mélòó ní ìtẹ̀léra ni ìfàṣẹ̀sí àkókò gbọ́dọ̀ kọjá ààlà kí a tó fi ìfitónilétí ránṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Àwọn Okùn Ìjẹ́rìísí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Òkùn Ìwádìí Ìdáhùn"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Èyí ni okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ láti wá nínú ìdáhùn fún iṣẹ́ tí ó wà láàyè tí ó sì ń ṣiṣẹ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Òkùn Ìwádìí Ìdáhùn - Àtúnṣe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Èyí ni okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ láti wá lórí Ìtọ́jú . Àyẹ̀wò Iṣẹ́ yóò ṣàyẹ̀wò fún okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ yìí tí kò bá rí okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ lókè. Tí ó bá rí i, ó túmọ̀ sí pé iṣẹ́ náà wà lábẹ́ ìtọ́jú."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Òkùn Ìwádìí Ìdáhùn - Kùnà"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Èyí ni okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ láti wá ìkùnà tí a mọ̀ nínú ìdáhùn iṣẹ́. Àyẹ̀wò Iṣẹ́ yóò kìlọ̀ nìkan tí a bá rí okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ yìí, nípa fífo àwọn ìṣòro àkókò-ìparí àti àwọn okùn-ọ̀rọ̀ ìwádìí lókè."

