#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Token value"
msgstr "Iye tókìnì"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Ó ṣeé lò fún ọ̀pọ̀ àyẹ̀wò iṣẹ́:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - àṣàyàn, tí a bá ṣètò rẹ̀, gbìyànjú ìfọwọ́sí ìpìlẹ̀ HTTP<br/><i>SMTP lórí èbúté 587</i> - àṣàyàn. Láìsí orúkọ olùlò/ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, ìdáhùn olùpèsè nìkan ni a ó ṣàyẹ̀wò. Pẹ̀lú orúkọ olùlò àti ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, ìwọlé náà yóò tún wáyé<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - àṣàyàn. Fún ftp aláìdámọ̀, lo orúkọ olùlò \"anonymous\" àti àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - pọndandan<br/><i>MQTT</i> - àṣàyàn<br/><i>Àṣẹ SCP, SSH</i> - o lè lo ọ̀nà yìí tàbí ọ̀nà kọ́kọ́rọ́ àdáni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Ìdánimọ̀ HTTP Ìpìlẹ̀. Orúkọ Olùlò àti Ọ̀rọ̀ Aṣínà ṣe pàtàkì"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Ìdánimọ̀ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API<br/>A máa ń fi ìdánimọ̀ ránṣẹ́ nínú àkọsílẹ̀ HTTP header, custom header tàbí ọ̀nà POST. Àwọn ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ nínú URL kò ní àtìlẹ́yìn.<br/>Fi orúkọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API àti ìwọ̀n rẹ̀ sí i. A nílò àwọn ìwọ̀n méjèèjì. Fún HTTP header orúkọ náà <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> ni a sábà máa ń lò (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Fún custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> ni a sábà máa ń lò (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Fún POST <i>api_key</i> ni a sábà máa ń lò."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Ìdánimọ̀ àmì OAuth2/Bearer<br/>O lè gba kọ́kọ́rọ́/àmì láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè kí o sì fi síbí tàbí kí o lo ìṣàn ìdánimọ̀ pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀. A máa ń fi Orúkọ Olùlò àti Ọ̀rọ̀ Aṣínà ránṣẹ́ ní ìlànà JSON."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Ìdánimọ̀ tó dá lórí Cookie - a nílò àwọn ìwọ̀n méjèèjì. Lẹ́yìn ìwọlé, a ó dá cookie padà"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 tàbí v2 - ó jẹ́ dandan, fi orúkọ àwùjọ síbí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Ìpele ààbò ni ó ń pinnu irú àwọn ìlànà tí a nílò"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Kọ́kọ́rọ́ ìkọ̀kọ̀ SSH - A lè lò ó fún ìdánwò SCP tàbí àṣẹ SSH. Àwọn ìdánwò wọ̀nyí tún lè lo orúkọ olùlò/ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà pẹ̀lú"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Ó ń ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá sẹ́fà wẹ́ẹ̀bù ń dáhùn nìkan. Tí a bá lo àlàyé orúkọ olùlò/ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, yóò gbìyànjú ìjẹ́rìísí Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Ó jẹ́ bákan náà pẹ̀lú HTTP ọ̀rọ̀ pẹrẹsẹ ṣùgbọ́n ó fi agbára láti dán àwọn ìwé-ẹ̀rí wò kún un."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Ó ń ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá sẹ́fà SMTP ń dáhùn nìkan. Kò sí ìjẹ́rìísí. Ìwọ yóò rí àsíá ìwọlé sẹ́fà àti ìdáhùn ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Àìdábòbò + STARTTLS. Ó tún ṣeé ṣe láti dán ìjẹ́òótọ́ ìwé-ẹ̀rí wò. Láìsí orúkọ olùlò àti ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, ìwọ yóò rí àsíá ìwọlé olùpèsè àti ìdáhùn ehlo. Pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀, ìwọlé yóò wáyé"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ tí a fi ààbò bo lórí ibùdó àìyípadà 465. Ó tún ṣeé ṣe láti dán ìwúlò ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà wò. Pẹ̀lú orúkọ olùlò àti ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, a ó dán AUTH LOGIN wò."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ IMAP àìdábòbò. Láìsí ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀, ìsopọ̀ nìkan ni a ó dán wò. Àsíá ìwọlé nìkan ni ìwọ yóò rí. Pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ a ó dán ìwọlé wò kí a sì gbìyànjú láti ka àtòjọ àwọn ìfìránṣẹ́. O lè lo ọ̀nà AUTHENTICATE PLAIN tàbí AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Ó jẹ́ bákan náà pẹ̀lú IMAP tí kò ní ìpamọ́ àṣírí ṣùgbọ́n lẹ́yìn ìwọlé a lo STARTTLS. Ó tún ṣeé ṣe láti dán ìjẹ́gẹ́gẹ́ ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà wò lẹ́yìn STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP tí a fi ààbò bo, o lè gbìyànjú ìwọlé kí o sì dán ìwé-ẹ̀rí àti ìwọlé olùlò wò"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ POP3 àìdábòbò. Láìsí ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀, ìsopọ̀ nìkan ni a ó dán wò. Àsíá ìwọlé nìkan ni ìwọ yóò rí. Pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ a ó dán ìwọlé wò kí a sì gbìyànjú láti ka àtòjọ àwọn ìfìránṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Ó jẹ́ bákan náà pẹ̀lú POP3 tí kò ní ìpamọ́ àṣírí ṣùgbọ́n lẹ́yìn ìwọlé a lo STARTTLS. Ó tún ṣeé ṣe láti dán ìjẹ́gẹ́gẹ́ ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà wò lẹ́yìn STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 tí a fi ààbò bo, o lè gbìyànjú ìwọlé kí o sì dán ìwé-ẹ̀rí àti ìwọlé olùlò wò."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Gbìyànjú láti túmọ̀ àkọsílẹ̀ DNS lórí olùpèsè DNS tí a tọ́ka sí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Gbìyànjú DNS lórí HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Gbogbo àwọn ààlà pàtàkì ni a nílò. Ṣe ìwọlé LDAP tí a kò pa lẹ́nu mọ́ àti ìṣàwárí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Gbogbo àwọn ààlà pàtàkì ni a nílò. Ṣe ìwọlé LDAP tí a pa lẹ́nu mọ́ àti ìṣàwárí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ FTP àìdábòbò, wọlé kí o sì gbìyànjú láti gba fáìlì tí a tọ́ka sí ní ipa-ọ̀nà (/path/to/file.txt) sílẹ̀. Fún ìsopọ̀ àìdámọ̀ lo ìwọlé *anonymous* àti àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà. A ó dá àkóónú fáìlì náà padà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Gbìyànjú láti gba fáìlì tí a tọ́ka sí ní ipa-ọ̀nà (/path/to/file.txt) sílẹ̀ láti orí olùpèsè TFTP. Àkóónú fáìlì náà ni yóò padà wá."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ SCP tí a fi ààbò bo, wọlé kí o sì gbìyànjú láti gba fáìlì tí a sọ nínú ọ̀nà (/path/to/file.txt) sílẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Gbìyànjú ìlànà SMB, a nílò orúkọ olùlò àti ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà. Gbìyànjú láti wọlé kí o sì gba fáìlì sílẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Sopọ̀ mọ́ sáfà MQTT kí o sì tẹ́tí sílẹ̀ fún ìránṣẹ́ èyíkéyìí. O lè tọ́ka kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ ní Ipa-ọ̀nà (bedroom/temp), fi sí òfo fún kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ èyíkéyìí. Fún àyẹ̀wò yìí, a gbani nímọ̀ràn láti mú \"Ìkìlọ̀ àkókò gígùn\" pọ̀ sí i"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ìdánwò REST API pẹ̀lú ìjẹ́rìísí HTTP ìpìlẹ̀. Pèsè ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé ní àkọ́kọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ìdánwò REST API pẹ̀lú ìjẹ́rìísí kọ́kọ́rọ́ API. Pèsè ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé ní àkọ́kọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ìdánwò REST API pẹ̀lú Oauth2. Pèsè ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé ní àkọ́kọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ìdánwò REST API pẹ̀lú ìjẹ́rìísí kọ́kì. Pèsè ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé ní àkọ́kọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Gbìyànjú ọ̀nà SNMP get. Àbájáde fún OID tí a tọ́ka sí ni yóò padà wá. A nílò ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀, o gbọ́dọ̀ pèsè ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ SNMP v.1,2 tàbí v3 tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Gbìyànjú ọ̀nà SNMP walk. Àbájáde fún OID tí a tọ́ka sí ni yóò padà wá. A nílò ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀, o gbọ́dọ̀ pèsè ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ SNMP v.1,2 tàbí v3 tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Lo ssh kí o sì so pọ̀ mọ́ olùgbàlejò òkèèrè. Lẹ́yìn ìwọlé, ṣiṣẹ́ àṣẹ tí a tọ́ka sí kí o sì dá èsì padà. Orúkọ olùlò àti ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà tàbí kọ́kọ́rọ́ àdáni ṣeé ṣe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Ìlànà SFTP lórí ibùdó 22, orúkọ olùlò àti ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà àti ọ̀nà jẹ́ dandan. Gbìyànjú láti ṣe àtòjọ àpò ìpamọ́ ti ọ̀nà náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Gbogbo rẹ̀ dára. Tẹ̀síwájú bí i ti tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL tí o fi ránṣẹ́ sí libcurl lo ìlànà kan tí libcurl yìí kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn rẹ̀. Àtìlẹ́yìn náà lè jẹ́ àṣàyàn àkókò ìkórajọ tí o kò lò, ó lè jẹ́ ọ̀rọ̀ ìlànà tí a ṣì kọ tàbí ìlànà kan tí libcurl kò ní kóòdù fún."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Kóòdù ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìpilẹ̀ṣẹ̀ kùnà. Èyí ṣeéṣe kí ó jẹ́ àṣìṣe tàbí ìṣòro inú, tàbí ìṣòro ohun àlùmọ́ọ́nì níbi tí ohun pàtàkì kan kò ti lè ṣe é lákòókò ìbẹ̀rẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "URL náà kò ní ìṣètò tó tọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Ẹ̀yà ara, ìlànà tàbí àṣàyàn tí a béèrè kò sí lára libcurl yìí nítorí ìpinnu àkókò ìkọ́lé. Èyí túmọ̀ sí pé a kò mú ẹ̀yà ara tàbí àṣàyàn kan ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí a pa á ní gbangba nígbà tí a kọ́ libcurl, àti pé kí ó lè ṣiṣẹ́ o gbọ́dọ̀ gba libcurl tí a tún kọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Kò lè túmọ̀ aṣojú (proxy). A kò lè túmọ̀ olùgbàlejò aṣojú tí a fúnni."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Kò lè túmọ̀ olùgbàlejò. A kò lè túmọ̀ olùgbàlejò òkèèrè tí a fúnni."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti ṣe connect() sí olùgbàlejò tàbí proxy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Olùpèsè náà fi dátà ránṣẹ́ tí libcurl kò lè túmọ̀. Kóòdù àṣìṣe yìí ni a mọ̀ sí CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY ṣáájú 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "A kọ̀ wá láti wọlé sí ohun ìní tí a fún nínu URL. Fún FTP, èyí máa ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá ń gbìyànjú láti yí padà sí àpò ìtòjọ òkèèrè."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a ń dúró de olùpèsè láti tún sopọ̀ padà nígbà tí a bá ń lo ìpàdé FTP aláápọn, a fi kóòdù àṣìṣe ránṣẹ́ lórí àsopọ̀ ìṣàkóso tàbí irú rẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Lẹ́yìn fífi ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà FTP ránṣẹ́ sí ẹ̀rọ olùpèsè, libcurl ń retí ìdáhùn tó tọ́. Kóòdù àṣìṣe yìí fi hàn pé kóòdù tí a kò retí ni a dá padà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Nígbà ìṣe FTP kan tó ń lọ lọ́wọ́ nígbà tí a ń dúró de sẹ́fà láti sopọ̀, àkókò ìdádúró CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (tàbí àkókò àìyípadà inú) ti parí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl kùnà láti gba àbájáde tó ní ìtumọ̀ padà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìdáhùn sí àṣẹ PASV tàbí EPSV. Olùpèsè náà ní àbùkù."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Àwọn olùpèsè FTP máa ń dá ìlà-227 padà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìdáhùn sí àṣẹ PASV. Tí libcurl bá kùnà láti túmọ̀ ìlà náà, kóòdù ìpadà yìí ni a ó fi padà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Ìkùnà abẹ́lé láti wá olùgbàlejò tí a lò fún ìsopọ̀ tuntun náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "A ṣàwárí ìṣòro kan ní ìpele ìṣàgbékalẹ̀ HTTP2. Èyí jẹ́ ti gbogboogbò díẹ̀, ó sì lè jẹ́ ọ̀kan lára ọ̀pọ̀ ìṣòro, wo ibi ìpamọ́ àṣìṣe fún àlàyé."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "A rí àṣìṣe nígbà tí a ń gbìyànjú láti ṣètò ipò ìfiránṣẹ́ sí báínárì tàbí ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Ìfiránṣẹ́ fáìlì kéré jù tàbí tóbi jù bí a ṣe retí lọ. Èyí máa ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nígbà tí olùpèsè bá kọ́kọ́ sọ ìwọ̀n ìfiránṣẹ́ tí a retí, tí ó sì wá fi dátà ránṣẹ́ tí kò bá ìwọ̀n tí a fún tẹ́lẹ̀ mu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Èyí jẹ́ yálà ìdáhùn àjèjì sí àṣẹ 'RETR' tàbí ìparí ìfiránṣẹ́ báìtì òdo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Àṣìṣe Tí Ó Ti Gbó"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "A kì í lò ó nínú àwọn ẹ̀dà òde òní."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń fi àwọn àṣẹ \"QUOTE\" àdáni ránṣẹ́ sí olùpèsè òkèèrè, ọ̀kan lára àwọn àṣẹ náà dá kóòdù àṣìṣe tó jẹ́ 400 tàbí jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ padà (fún FTP) tàbí tọ́ka sí àìṣàṣeyọrí ìparí àṣẹ náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Èyí ni a ń dá padà tí a bá ṣètò CURLOPT_FAILONERROR sí òótọ́ (true) tí olùpèsè HTTP sì dá kóòdù àṣìṣe tó jẹ́ >= 400 padà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Àṣìṣe kan ṣẹlẹ̀ nígbà tí a ń kọ dátà tí a gbà sínú fáìlì abẹ́lé, tàbí a dá àṣìṣe kan padà sí libcurl láti inú ìpèpadà ìkọ̀wé."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìgbésókè. Fún FTP, olùpèsè sábà máa ń kọ àṣẹ STOR. Àpò ìpamọ́ àṣìṣe sábà máa ń ní àlàyé olùpèsè fún èyí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Ìṣòro wà ní kíkà fáìlì abẹ́lé kan tàbí àṣìṣe kan wáyé látọwọ́ ìpèpadà kíkà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Ìbéèrè ìpínkiri ìrántí kùnà. Èyí jẹ́ ìṣòro líle gan-an, nǹkan sì ti bàjẹ́ gidigidi bí èyí bá ṣẹlẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Àkókò iṣẹ́ ti parí. Àkókò ìdádúró tí a tọ́ka sí ti pé gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn ipò náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Àṣẹ FTP PORT dá àṣìṣe padà. Èyí máa ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nígbà púpọ̀ tí o kò bá tọ́ka sí àdírẹ́sì tó dára tó fún libcurl láti lò. Wo CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Àṣẹ FTP REST dá àṣìṣe padà. Èyí kò gbọdọ̀ ṣẹlẹ̀ láé tí olùpèsè bá wà ní ipò tó dára."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Olùpèsè náà kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn tàbí gba àwọn ìbéèrè ààlà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Èyí jẹ́ àṣìṣe àjèjì kan tó sábà máa ń ṣẹlẹ̀ nítorí ìdàrúdàpọ̀ inú."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Ìṣòro kan ṣẹlẹ̀ níbì kan nínú ìbáraẹnisọ̀rọ̀ SSL/TLS. O nílò ibi ìpamọ́ àṣìṣe láti ka ìfiranṣẹ́ ibẹ̀ nítorí ó ń tọ́ka sí ìṣòro náà dáadáa sí i. Ó lè jẹ́ àwọn ìwé-ẹ̀rí (irú fáìlì, ọ̀nà, àṣẹ), àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, àti àwọn mìíràn."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "A kò lè tẹ̀síwájú ìgbàsílẹ̀ náà nítorí ìyapa tí a sọ pàtó kọjá ààlà fáìlì náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Fáìlì tí a fún nípasẹ̀ FILE:// kò ṣeé ṣí. Ó ṣeé ṣe kí ó jẹ́ nítorí ọ̀nà fáìlì kò tọ́ka sí fáìlì tó wà. Ṣé o ti ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àṣẹ fáìlì?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP kò le so pọ̀. Iṣẹ́ ìsopọ̀ LDAP kùnà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Àwárí LDAP kùnà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Kò rí iṣẹ́ náà. A kò rí iṣẹ́ zlib kan tí a nílò."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Ìpèpadà dá a dúró. Ìpèpadà kan dá \"abort\" padà sí libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "A pe iṣẹ́ kan pẹ̀lú pàrámítà àìtọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Àṣìṣe ìsopọ̀. A kò lè lo ìsopọ̀ àbájáde tí a tọ́ka sí. Ṣètò ìsopọ̀ tí a óò lò fún àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì IP orísun àwọn ìsopọ̀ àbájáde pẹ̀lú URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Àwọn àtúndarí pọ̀ jù. Nígbà tí ó ń tẹ̀lé àwọn àtúndarí, libcurl dé iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ. Ṣètò ààlà rẹ pẹ̀lú CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "A kò dá àṣàyàn tí a fi ránṣẹ́ sí libcurl mọ̀. Wo ìwé àkọsílẹ̀ tó yẹ. Èyí ṣeé ṣe kí ó jẹ́ ìṣòro nínú ètò tí ó ń lo libcurl. Àpótí ìpamọ́ àṣìṣe lè ní àlàyé pàtó sí i nípa irú àṣàyàn tí ó kàn."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Àṣàyàn kan tí a fi sí inú setopt kò ní ìṣètò tó tọ́. Wo ìránṣẹ́ àṣìṣe fún àlàyé nípa àṣàyàn náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Kò sí ohun tí a dá padà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè ìṣẹ́, àti lábẹ́ ipò yìí, àìrí nǹkan kankan jẹ́ àṣìṣe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "A kò rí ẹ́ńjìnì ìpamọ́ àṣírí tí a pàtó."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti ṣètò ẹ́ńjìnì ìfipamọ́ SSL tí a yàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọ́ṣe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti fi dátà nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì ránṣẹ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Ìkùnà nípa gbígba dátà nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "ìṣòro pẹ̀lú ìwé-ẹ̀rí olùbẹ̀wò abẹ́lé."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Kò lè lo ìpamọ́ tí a tọ́ka sí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Ìwé-ẹ̀rí SSL olùpèsè òkèèrè tàbí àtẹ̀gùn ìka SSH kò dára. A ti so kóòdù àṣìṣe yìí pọ̀ mọ́ CURLE_SSL_CACERT láti 7.62.0. Iye rẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀ jẹ́ 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Ìṣàkójọpọ̀ ìfiránṣẹ́ àìmọ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n fáìlì tó pọ̀ jù lọ ti kọjá."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Ìpele FTP SSL tí a béèrè kùnà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a ń ṣe iṣẹ́ ìfiránṣẹ́, curl ní láti yí dátà padà sẹ́yìn láti tún ránṣẹ́, ṣùgbọ́n iṣẹ́ yíyípadà sẹ́yìn náà kùnà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ Ẹ́ńjìnì SSL kùnà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Olùpèsè òkèèrè kọ̀ fún curl láti wọlé (A fi kún un ní 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "A kò rí fáìlì lórí olùpèsè TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Ìṣòro àṣẹ lórí olùpèsè TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Àyè díìsìkì ti tán lórí olùpèsè."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Ìṣiṣẹ́ TFTP tí kò bófin mu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "ID ìfiránṣẹ́ TFTP àìmọ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Fáìlì náà ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀, a kò sì kọ lé e lórí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Olùpèsè TFTP tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa kò gbọ́dọ̀ dá àṣìṣe yìí padà láéláé."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Ìṣòro wà nípa kíkà ìwé-ẹ̀rí SSL CA (ọ̀nà? ẹ̀tọ́ ìwọlé?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Ohun àlùmọ́nì tí a tọ́ka sí nínú URL náà kò sí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Àṣìṣe tí a kò sọ pàtó kan ṣẹlẹ̀ ní àkókò ìpàdé SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti pa ìsopọ̀ SSL náà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Socket kò tíì ṣetán fún fífi ránṣẹ́/gbígba, dúró títí yóò fi ṣetán kí o sì tún gbìyànjú. Kóòdù ìpadà yìí nìkan ni a ń dá padà láti curl_easy_recv àti curl_easy_send (Tí a fi kún un ní 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti kó fáìlì CRL wọlé (A fi kún un ní 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Àyẹ̀wò olùfúnni kùnà (Ti fi kún un ní 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Olùpèsè FTP kò lóye àṣẹ PRET rárá tàbí kò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún àríyànjiyàn tí a fún un. Ṣọ́ra nígbà tí o bá ń lo CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a máa ń fi àṣẹ LIST àdáni ránṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú àṣẹ PRET ṣáájú PASV pẹ̀lú. (A fi kún un ní 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Àìbáramu àwọn nọ́mbà RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Àìbáramu àwọn Olùdámọ̀ Ìgbà RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Kò le tú àtòjọ fáìlì FTP (nígbà ìgbàsílẹ̀ àmì-àìpàtó FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Ìpèpadà apá ròyìn àṣìṣe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Fún ìlò inú nìkan, libcurl kì í dá a padà láé) Kò sí àsopọ̀ kankan, a ti fi ìgbà ìṣiṣẹ́ sí ìlà. (a fi kún un ní 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Kíkùnà láti bá kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí a lẹ̀ mọ́ tí a sọ pẹ̀lú CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY mu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Ipò dá ìkùnà padà nígbà tí a béèrè rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Àṣìṣe ìṣàn-dátà ní ìpele àgbékalẹ̀ HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "A pe iṣẹ́ API kan láti inú ìpèpadà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ ìdánimọ̀ kan dá àṣìṣe kan padà."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "A ṣàwárí ìṣòro kan ní ìpele HTTP/3. Èyí jẹ́ ti gbogboogbò díẹ̀, ó sì lè jẹ́ ọ̀kan lára ọ̀pọ̀ ìṣòro, wo ibi ìpamọ́ àṣìṣe fún àlàyé."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Àṣìṣe ìsopọ̀ QUIC. Àṣìṣe yìí lè jẹ́ látọ̀dọ̀ àṣìṣe ilé-ìkàwé SSL. QUIC ni ìlànà tí a ń lò fún ìfiránṣẹ́ HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Àṣìṣe ìbáraẹnisọ̀rọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ ti Proxy. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR pèsè àlàyé kíkún lórí ìṣòro náà pàtó."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "A nílò Ìwé-ẹ̀rí Oníbàárà SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Ìpè abẹ́lé sí poll() tàbí select() dá àṣìṣe tí kò ṣe é tún ṣe padà."

