msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Àwọn Ààyò Ìfitọ́nilétí"

#: setup.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Fi Ímeèlì ránṣẹ́ lọ́tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀ fún àdírẹ́sì kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: setup.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Tí a bá yàn án, èyí yóò mú kí gbogbo Ímeèlì jẹ́ fífiránṣẹ́ lọ́tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀ fún àdírẹ́sì kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Stop sending all notification"
msgstr "Dá fífiránṣẹ́ gbogbo ìfitónilétí dúró"

#: setup.php
msgid "If checked, servcheck will not send any emails. You can also disable notification only for specific tests"
msgstr "Bí a bá fọwọ́ sí i, servcheck kò ní fi ímeèlì kankan ránṣẹ́. O tún lè pa ìfitónilétí nìkan fún àwọn ìdánwò pàtó"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Mú Ìṣiṣẹ́ Àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ́"

#: setup.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Servcheck events. You can enable or disable it for each test."
msgstr "Fífì àmì sí àpótí yìí yóò mú agbára láti ṣiṣẹ́ àwọn àṣẹ lórí àwọn ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Servcheck ṣiṣẹ́. O lè mú un ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí kí o pa á fún ìdánwò kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Status Change Command"
msgstr "Àṣẹ Ìyípadà Ipò"

#: setup.php
msgid "When a basic or search or certificate expiration test returns different result, run the following command... This command must NOT include command line arguments... However, the following variables can be pulled from the environment of the script:<br>&#060SERVCHECK_TEST_NAME&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_EXTERNAL_ID&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_TEST_TYPE&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_POLLER_ID&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_RESULT&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_RESULT_SEARCH&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_CERTIFICATE_EXPIRATION&#062"
msgstr "Nígbà tí ìdánwò ìpìlẹ̀ tàbí àwárí tàbí ìparí ìwé-ẹ̀rí bá dá èsì tó yàtọ̀ padà, ṣiṣẹ́ àṣẹ ìsàlẹ̀ yìí... Àṣẹ yìí kò gbọ́dọ̀ ní àwọn àríyànjiyàn ìlà àṣẹ nínú... Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, a lè fa àwọn onírúurú wọ̀nyí jáde láti àyíká ìwé àṣẹ náà:<br>&#060SERVCHECK_TEST_NAME&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_EXTERNAL_ID&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_TEST_TYPE&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_POLLER_ID&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_RESULT&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_RESULT_SEARCH&#062 &#060SERVCHECK_CERTIFICATE_EXPIRATION&#062"

#: setup.php
msgid "Concurrent Check Processes"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìlànà Àyẹ̀wò Lẹ́ẹ̀kan-náà"

#: setup.php
msgid "The number of service check processes to run concurrently.  Increasing this number to 2 times the number of cores is not advised."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìlànà àyẹ̀wò iṣẹ́ láti ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà.  Fífẹ̀ iye yìí dé ìlọ́po 2 iye àwọn kọ́ọ̀ kò gbani níyànjú."

